0tqXQwKMcAV2.jpg"},{"id":5255301,"name":"Chiara Marchiori","role":"Sorella di un prigioniero"},{"id":1566482,"name":"Eva Kuen","role":"Donna Fattoria","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bXQVCvEl7fhBA00Q3bvCCmw5hVo.jpg"},{"id":1485299,"name":"Roman Weishaupt","role":"Alfred Siegfried"},{"id":64265,"name":"Jörg Reichlin","role":"Anton"},{"id":5255302,"name":"Alessandro Zappella"},{"id":2362021,"name":"Anina Sara Baumgartner","role":"Signora invitata Klara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3FqF5lKCRHMujywJoflo4pqpLmN.jpg"},{"id":2185860,"name":"Christian Bianco","role":"Passeur"},{"id":5255303,"name":"Filippo Giulini","role":"Antonio"},{"id":5211316,"name":"Federica Garavaglia"},{"id":5255304,"name":"Francesco Limenta"},{"id":1832864,"name":"Werner Biermeier","role":"Uomo Calvo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tnGBzMOQcOuqKiMX7ukTMdX3Lg7.jpg"},{"id":1086277,"name":"Christoph Gaugler","role":"Mostler","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4seaVimdqh7iivh5YtlZpzc4Fv2.jpg"},{"id":3272996,"name":"Markus Westphal","role":"Custode"},{"id":5339376,"name":"Sophie Agnese Krause","role":"Donna Jenisch"},{"id":5339377,"name":"Cyrill Birchler","role":"Soldier"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Lubo Moser è uno jenisch, uno zingaro. Mirana, che ha cercato di opporsi, è stata uccisa. Ma com’era potuto accadere? Perché? Perché la Svizzera considera il nomadismo una piaga sociale, e, per sradicarlo, si prende i bambini degli jenisch. Così, senza bambini, gli jenisch saranno senza futuro. La mente è un’istituzione umanitaria statale, la Pro Juventute, il braccio l’Opera Bambini di Strada: tutto è perfettamente legale e non ci si può opporre alla legge. Lubo si sente morire. E qualcosa di lui muore davvero, in quella notte di vento e neve: sarà un nuovo Lubo, duro e impenetrabile, a mettere a punto un progetto con risvolti inaspettati per vendicare la sua famiglia e la sua gente… e ci porterà a ripensare il senso di giustizia, nei labili confini tra il bene ed male."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Lubo Moser is a jenisch, a gypsy. Mirana, who tried to oppose him, was killed. But how could this have happened? Why? Because Switzerland considers nomadism a social scourge, and, to eradicate it, it takes the children of the jenisch. Thus, without children, the Jenisch will be without a future. The mastermind is a state-run humanitarian institution, Pro Juventute, the arm the Street Children's Work: everything is perfectly legal and there is no opposition to the law. Lubo feels himself dying. And something about him really does die, on that night of wind and snow: it will be a new Lubo, tough and impenetrable, who will set up a project with unexpected implications to avenge his family and his people... and it will lead us to rethink the sense of justice, in the blurred boundaries between good and evil."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2kcyL3GW8etVjT4oSy45wb1zPrw.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2kcyL3GW8etVjT4oSy45wb1zPrw.png","language":"en","width":702,"height":201}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9yZPMPCLrSaVw5Ov6wIxcsP6kq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r9yZPMPCLrSaVw5Ov6wIxcsP6kq.jpg","language":"it","width":1050,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n7m7p8G29MWvb18f2Au0TG1rqQi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n7m7p8G29MWvb18f2Au0TG1rqQi.jpg","language":"it","width":874,"height":1227},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rRWa8wPrSvAyH1DxkeS2ejJyiMw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rRWa8wPrSvAyH1DxkeS2ejJyiMw.jpg","language":"it","width":1206,"height":1812},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5ocM95wpanorj79skkTw175FAt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5ocM95wpano